<title>INDIA: Delhi shares trade flat in early trade.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares trade flat in early trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares opened virtually unchanged on Thursday as local mutual funds stayed on the sidelines amid selective buying by foreign investors, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Delhi bourse's benchmark index was down 0.30 points at 770.45 after 30 minutes of trade.</p>
